==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*koolëma}}, equivalent to {{suffix|fi|kuolla|t1=to die|ma|id2=nominal}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-pronunciation}}

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# [[death]], [[demise]], [[decease]]
#: {{syn|fi|poismeno<q:euphemistic>|kuolo<q:poetic>|tuoni<q:poetic, archaic>}}
#: {{coi|fi|tuomita '''kuolemaan'''|to sentence '''to death''' / to condemn '''to death'''}}
#: {{coi|fi|olla '''kuolemaisillaan'''|to [[be]] [[at death's door]]/[[dying]]/near [[death]]}}
#: {{coi|fi|olla '''kuoleman''' kielissä|to [[be]] [[at death's door]]}}
#: {{coi|fi|tehdä '''kuolemaa'''|to [[be]] [[die|dying]]}}
#: {{ux|fi|Hän on '''kuoleman'''kalpea.|He has a '''deathly''' pallor.}}

====Declension====
{{fi-decl-koira|kuolem|||a}}

